Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.06,0:00:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, and so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.74,0:00:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.78,0:00:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.22,0:01:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there. You will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.98,0:01:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.84,0:01:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.34,0:01:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:02:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready? Aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.84,0:02:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.38,0:02:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting is not going to help anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.72,0:02:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.02,0:02:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only grazed my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.42,0:02:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.33,0:02:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't land.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.54,0:02:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But can you please call us a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.36,0:02:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our friend is dying from a\Nserious illness. I'm begging you.

